<title>SWITZERLAND: Results of Swiss Federal Bond auction.</title>
<headline>Results of Swiss Federal Bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following terms were announced by the Swiss Treasury and the Swiss National Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p>Tranche 1 -</p>
<p> TOTAL AMT 310.0 MLN CHF  COUPON 5-1/2     MATURITY   06.Jan.05</p>
<p> TYPE   fixed-rate    ISS PRICE  111.50    PAY DATE   07.Oct.96</p>
<p> YIELD TO MATURITY    3.844 PCT</p>
<p>TOTAL BIDS 489.6 MLN CHF</p>
<p>LOCAL CODE 525 428  (Fungible with 322 523)</p>
<p>Tranche 2 -</p>
<p>BORROWER - Swiss Government</p>
<p> AMT 1.0 BLN CHF     COUPON     4-1/4     MATURITY   08.Jan.08</p>
<p> TYPE  fixed-rate   ISS PRICE  100.60    PAY DATE   07.Oct.96</p>
<p> YIELD TO MATURITY   4.180 PCT</p>
<p>TOTAL BIDS 1,598.9 MLN CHF</p>
<p>LOCAL CODE 525 437 (Fungible with 108 546)</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
